{"parse":{"title":"特性/污域蔓延","pageid":7375,"revid":17899,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%B1%A1%E5%9F%9F%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%B1%A1%E5%9F%9F%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%B1%A1%E5%9F%9F%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>污域蔓延</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.B1.A1.E5.9F.9F.E8.94.93.E5.BB.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"污域蔓延\"><b>污域蔓延</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 污域蔓延.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/12/7pktwktj146udbdbek7idcdvuvm2hqt.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E6%B1%A1%E5%9F%9F%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/12/7pktwktj146udbdbek7idcdvuvm2hqt.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E6%B1%A1%E5%9F%9F%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/12/7pktwktj146udbdbek7idcdvuvm2hqt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />污域蔓延\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]、免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冥炎之径\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冥炎之径</font></span></span>]地形效果。<br />✦受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>。受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"失衡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">失衡</font></span></span>]状态时，受到伤害增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，会将场上一定数量地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冥炎之径\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冥炎之径</font></span></span>]。<br />✦受到一定伤害后，自身获得大幅强化。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%B9%BF%E9%A6%96%E7%B2%BE\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/鹿首精\"><img alt=\"鹿首精 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/7p0128cznahucrvdnapd3motkps3cky.png/75px-%E9%B9%BF%E9%A6%96%E7%B2%BE_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/7p0128cznahucrvdnapd3motkps3cky.png/113px-%E9%B9%BF%E9%A6%96%E7%B2%BE_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/7p0128cznahucrvdnapd3motkps3cky.png/150px-%E9%B9%BF%E9%A6%96%E7%B2%BE_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"192\" data-file-height=\"192\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164205\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 538/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9876/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1993/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   85.575      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   85.575      1 -total\n 57.80%   49.462      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 53.67%   45.928      4 模板:中括号介绍\n 11.09%    9.492      1 模板:面包屑\n  7.20%    6.165      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7375-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164205 and revision id 17899. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_污域蔓延.png","鹿首精_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>污域蔓延</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"污域蔓延"}],"displaytitle":"特性/污域蔓延","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=鹿首精\n|特性名称=污域蔓延\n|特性图标=污域蔓延\n|特性描述=✦免疫[<font color=#f3c156>×反应技</font>]、免疫[<font color=#54b4db>冥炎之径</font>]地形效果。<br>✦受到伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>50%</font>。受到[失衡]状态时，受到伤害增加<font color=#ed7950>20%</font>。<br>✦行动开始时，会将场上一定数量地形格变为[冥炎之径]。<br>✦受到一定伤害后，自身获得大幅强化。\n}}"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:05.705730+00:00"}